---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon';
import Timeline from '../components/Timeline';
import Graph from '../components/Graph';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import profile from '../../assets/imgs/profile.png';
---
<Layout title="AI research, engineering & technical leadership" description="Ali Mokh, PhD. Researcher Concept AI at Ericsson France. GenAI, GraphRAG, MLOps and telecom research, project leadership and education.">
<section class="home-hero shell"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="gold-rule"></span> ALI MOKH, PhD <span class="muted">/ AI RESEARCHER</span></div><h1>Research meets<br/><em>real-world AI.</em></h1><p class="hero-intro">I connect deep technical knowledge with the systems, people and practices that turn AI research into useful applications.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/projects.html">Explore my work <Icon name="arrow" size={19}/></a><a class="button text" href="#experience">My journey <Icon name="down" size={18}/></a></div><div class="hero-role"><span class="role-icon"><Icon name="network" size={23}/></span><div><strong>Researcher Concept AI</strong><span>Ericsson France · since October 2023</span></div></div></div><div class="hero-portrait"><div class="portrait-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="portrait-label"><Icon name="pin" size={15}/> BASED IN FRANCE</div><Image src={profile} alt="Portrait of Ali Mokh in his AI and engineering workspace" width={800} format="webp" quality={88} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" class="profile-image"/><div class="portrait-caption"><span>CONNECTING THE DOTS</span><strong>AI · Knowledge · Telecom</strong></div></div></section>
<div class="discipline-strip"><div class="shell"><span>GenAI & agents</span><span>GraphRAG</span><span>MLOps</span><span>4G · 5G · 6G</span><span>Technical leadership</span></div></div>
<section class="section shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-number">01 / WHAT I BRING</span><h2>Depth across disciplines.<br/><em>Clarity across the lifecycle.</em></h2></div><p>From scientific questions to architecture decisions and knowledge transfer.</p></div><div class="expertise-grid"><article><Icon name="network" size={32}/><span class="card-index">01</span><h3>Knowledge & intelligence</h3><p>GenAI, GraphRAG and agentic workflows that connect complex technical information to useful answers.</p><span class="small-label">RAG · KNOWLEDGE GRAPHS · AWS BEDROCK</span></article><article><Icon name="box" size={32}/><span class="card-index">02</span><h3>Systems & engineering</h3><p>Reproducible experiments, cloud architecture and MLOps practices that support the path beyond a prototype.</p><span class="small-label">PYTHON · AWS · MLFLOW · KUBERNETES</span></article><article><Icon name="radio" size={32}/><span class="card-index">03</span><h3>Telecom & applied research</h3><p>Wireless systems, signal processing and AI, grounded in a PhD and industrial research experience.</p><span class="small-label">4G / 5G / 6G · RL · COMPUTER VISION</span></article></div></section>
<section class="featured-section"><div class="shell feature-layout"><div><span class="section-number">02 / IN FOCUS</span><h2>Complex knowledge.<br/><em>Connected intelligence.</em></h2><p>3GPP Knowledge Fabric brings together technical specifications, knowledge graphs and retrieval to support telecom AI research.</p><div class="tags"><span>GraphRAG</span><span>Amazon Neptune</span><span>Agentic workflows</span></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects.html#knowledge-fabric">Explore the project <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div><Graph client:visible/></div></section>
<section class="section shell" id="experience"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-number">03 / THE JOURNEY</span><h2>Built on research.<br/><em>Broadened by practice.</em></h2></div><p>Industrial AI, experimental telecom, project coordination and teaching. Several activities run concurrently.</p></div><Timeline client:visible/></section>
<section class="education-section shell" id="education"><span class="section-number">THE FOUNDATIONS</span><div class="education-grid"><article><Icon name="graduation" size={27}/><span>2018</span><h3>PhD, Digital Communications</h3><p>INSA Rennes</p></article><article><Icon name="layers" size={27}/><span>2015</span><h3>M2, Signal Processing</h3><p>Grenoble INP – Phelma</p></article><article><Icon name="compass" size={27}/><span>2015</span><h3>Telecommunications Engineering</h3><p>Lebanese University</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-number">04 / BEYOND THE RESEARCH</span><h2>Build. Share.<br/><em>Move ideas forward.</em></h2></div><p>My direction is toward broader R&amp;D Director, Head of AI and CTO responsibilities, building on research, architecture, project coordination and teaching.</p></div><div class="path-grid"><a href="/teaching.html" class="path-card"><Icon name="book" size={30}/><span class="overline">TEACHING & TRAINING</span><h3>Make complex ideas<br/>click.</h3><p>ESILV, professional training and practical courses in AI, MLOps, Python and telecom.</p><span class="text-link">Explore teaching <Icon name="arrow"/></span></a><a href="/consultancy.html" class="path-card"><Icon name="compass" size={30}/><span class="overline">CONSULTANCY & DELIVERY</span><h3>Give ambitious work<br/>a clear direction.</h3><p>Architecture, technical decisions and coordination grounded in research and engineering.</p><span class="text-link">Explore collaboration <Icon name="arrow"/></span></a></div></section>
</Layout>
